   "110": {
    "color": "Blue",
    "duration": 1,
    "note": "Joe Wilson, Shriners Children's | C0523 ii.MP4 251.38-261.23 s\nThis is a population of men who are making a difference that usually we would not expect a difference to be made from.",
    "name": "02 Men making a difference we would not expect",
    "customData": ""
   },
   "346": {
    "color": "Blue",
    "duration": 1,
    "note": "Norman Williams, started the walkathon | A7Siii0491.MP4 135.98-150.70 s\nSo, I started out making donations to Shriners Hospital, $10 donation every two or three months.",
    "name": "03 Origin: Norman's $10 donations, wanted to do more",
    "customData": ""
   },
   "699": {
    "color": "Blue",
    "duration": 1,
    "note": "Norman Williams, started the walkathon | A7Siii0491.MP4 166.96-173.37 s\nAnd after making this donation I felt like I was not doing enough. So I want to do more.",
    "name": "04 Origin: Norman's $10 donations, wanted to do more",
    "customData": ""
   },
   "853": {
    "color": "Blue",
    "duration": 1,
    "note": "Joe Wilson, Shriners Children's | C0523 ii.MP4 74.20-76.45 s\nthat gentleman right there wrote me a letter.",
    "name": "05 That gentleman wrote me a letter",
    "customData": ""
   },
   "907": {
    "color": "Blue",
    "duration": 1,
    "note": "Jeffrey Burke, organizer | C0525 II.MP4 154.32-159.41 s\nAnd Mr. Joe Wilson accepted. He wrote me back a letter and accepted our proposal.",
    "name": "06 Joe Wilson accepted",
    "customData": ""
   },
   "1029": {
    "color": "Blue",
    "duration": 1,
    "note": "Daniel Henson | C0519 ii.MP4 328.26-342.79 s\nIt's everything to me. I can't revive the lives I took. I can't undo my past, but I can give back. I can prevent harm. I can contribute to society. I can help raise some money for Shriners so some kid doesn't have to be sick. Some",
    "name": "07 Daniel: I can give back, so some kid doesn't have to be sick",
    "customData": ""
   },
   "1377": {
    "color": "Blue",
    "duration": 1,
    "note": "Elijah Johnson | A7Siii0508.MP4 445.28-447.70 s\nif you're still alive, you have something to give back.",
    "name": "08 Eli: you have something to give back",
    "customData": ""
   },
   "1435": {
    "color": "Blue",
    "duration": 1,
    "note": "Joe Wilson, Shriners Children's | C0523 ii.MP4 124.68-130.73 s\nit's about telling the story of who we are what we do what the magic that we make happen for kiddos who need us",
    "name": "09 The magic we make happen for kiddos",
    "customData": ""
   },
   "1580": {
    "color": "Blue",
    "duration": 1,
    "note": "Joe Wilson, Shriners Children's | C0523 ii.MP4 145.40-146.95 s\nWe're there to say yes, we can help. That's what we do.",
    "name": "10 We're there to say yes",
    "customData": ""
   },
   "1617": {
    "color": "Blue",
    "duration": 1,
    "note": "Joe Wilson, Shriners Children's | C0523 ii.MP4 148.01-148.75 s\nWe're there to say yes, we can help. That's what we do.",
    "name": "11 We're there to say yes",
    "customData": ""
   },
   "1635": {
    "color": "Blue",
    "duration": 1,
    "note": "Joe Wilson, Shriners Children's | C0523 ii.MP4 378.62-382.35 s\nUltimately, I thought it was going to be a lot of anger",
    "name": "12 Expected anger and intimidation; saw none",
    "customData": ""
   },
   "1724": {
    "color": "Blue",
    "duration": 1,
    "note": "Joe Wilson, Shriners Children's | C0523 ii.MP4 385.98-389.89 s\nand intimidation. I've seen none of that today.",
    "name": "13 Expected anger and intimidation; saw none",
    "customData": ""
   },
   "1818": {
    "color": "Blue",
    "duration": 1,
    "note": "Joe Wilson, Shriners Children's | C0523 ii.MP4 438.16-458.45 s\nI would see kids, our patients, who are using prosthetics. They might have a burn on their whole face, using a cannula, an oxygen to be forced to air, and smiling and laughing. And that puts things into perspective, doesn't it?",
    "name": "14 Kids at the hospital: perspective",
    "customData": ""
   },
   "2304": {
    "color": "Blue",
    "duration": 1,
    "note": "Joe Wilson, Shriners Children's | C0523 ii.MP4 471.06-472.23 s\nThis does the same thing.",
    "name": "15 This does the same thing",
    "customData": ""
   },
   "2332": {
    "color": "Blue",
    "duration": 1,
    "note": "Elijah Johnson | A7Siii0508.MP4 909.46-916.00 s\nI want to build something where kids could go to and be safe. Call this place home.",
    "name": "16 Eli: a place where kids can be safe",
    "customData": ""
   },
   "2489": {
